From: Andrei-Alexandru Bleortu <me@andrei-z.com>
Subject: [PATCH] nat46: include net/dsfield.h for ipv4_get_dsfield()

The TOS translation reads the IPv4 DS field through ipv4_get_dsfield(),
which on 7.x is no longer reachable through net/route.h; include its own
header.
---
--- a/nat46/modules/nat46-core.c
+++ b/nat46/modules/nat46-core.c
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@
 
 #include <linux/version.h>
 #include <net/route.h>
+#include <net/dsfield.h>
 #if LINUX_VERSION_CODE < KERNEL_VERSION(4,19,0)
 #include <net/ipv6.h>
 #else
